Z||000000||FieroJoe||11-12-2000||09:41 PM||||Anybody have any pro's and con's of the Accel Pro-Ignition DIS coils that are availble?  I was thinking about getting some, but wanted to see what other people had to say about them.  Thanks!<P>------------------<BR>"The fish who keeps on swimming is the first to chill upstream"||||reg||4
Z||000001||theogre||11-12-2000||11:06 PM||||read the DIS article in my cave. <A HREF="http://fierocave.shorturl.com" TARGET=_blank>The Fiero Cave</A> I have them. I'm not very impressed with them. If you are missing the metal shield that fits on top of the ignition module the coils will likely over heat and shut down. (OE coils will run w/o the shield.)<P>They also don't fit w/o altering the module or the coils. I refuse to alter a $130+ module to accept them. I altered the coils instead.||||reg||1
